    "text": "<p>Flux does not change suddenly.</p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><!--?xml version=\"1.0\"?--> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><!--?xml version=\"1.0\"?--> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>",
